Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:18.95,main,Students,0,0,0,,How about tennis? You interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.95,sign_455_4_Bulletin_Board,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HE6D2DD&\c&H9B8B8B&\frz9.099\frx12\fry336\pos(111.857,113)}{\blur1\3c&HE6D4D9&\fs20}Bulletin Board
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.95,sign_455_5_Soccer_Club____B,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,142)\frz6.393\3c&HF2F3F2&}Soccer Club     Baseball Club                  Soft Tennis Club now recruiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.95,sign_455_6_Band_Club______D,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz351\c&H5B565D&\pos(198,272)}Concert Band   Drama Club          Kendo Club
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.36,main,Students,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.96,main,Students,0,0,0,,Okay, right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:39.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Did I take a wrong turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:45.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:51.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Do you know where the room \Nfor the drama club is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You a new student?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:53.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:57.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Perfect, I happen to be the club's pres...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:01.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,President! Kitahama Eiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:04.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Nanakura Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sorry to spring this on you \Nwhen you were hoping to sign up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm the only member at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:15.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It'd be great if you joined, \Nbut no pressure, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay! Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:20.88,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Wow, it's like in \N"The Beginning of a Story."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:25.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Anyway, the club room is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:26.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:28.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, welcome to Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Prez! We got a new recruit, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:39.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I thought you were the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:42.78,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Eiji... were you messing around, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:47.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Whacha think? Just like in \N"The Beginning of a Story", wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.17,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He seems kind of weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:55.70,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,So you're looking to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:58.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! I'm interested in acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.38,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Could you try reading this bit, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:02.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,R-Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:04.52,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Yes! Okay, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:10.64,main,Prez,0,0,0,,O, speak again, bright angel, for thou art as \Nglorious to this night, being o’er my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.69,main,Prez,0,0,0,,as is a winged messenger of heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,There he goes again...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:18.32,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Go on, it's your line now. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:34.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,O Romeo, Romeo, wherefore art thou Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:39.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Deny thy father and refuse thy name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:43.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,and I'll no longer be a Capulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:48.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.85,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Yep, Romeo here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:56.73,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,What are you doing, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:02:58.94,main,Prez,0,0,0,,I mean, she kind of bowled me over...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.22,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Uh, what was your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's Nanakura Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:06.62,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Nanakura-san, we'd love \Nto have you join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:14.46,main,Club A,0,0,0,,Why's she thanking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.00,main,Club B(Female),0,0,0,,We're glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.21,main,Club C (female),0,0,0,,That was pretty impressive just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:20.56,main,Club B,0,0,0,,It was fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:57.94,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(565,518)\pos(449,313)}Episode 1        The Beginning of a Story?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:04:57.99,main - top,VB Club,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.35,main,VB Club,0,0,0,,Nice kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:06.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The truth is, all guys wish they could \Nbe popular at least once in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:09.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're actually interested \Nin romance, senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.11,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wow, rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:14.63,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Even I dream about having a harem, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A harem...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:23.39,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe I should take you out \Nfor a date sometime, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What brought that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:29.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-It was acting! I was teasing you \Nlike one of those impish girls do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:32.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you acting out a simulated \Nharem experience, all for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Aw, you're a real sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:39.47,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I was \Ndoing it for your sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:44.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Your imp act is good, \Nbut it's hard to say no to a tsundere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:48.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'd be able to choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:51.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now I know how tough \Nhaving a harem would actually be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You've got real acting chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:58.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I like acting around you \Nfor some reason, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, are you acting now? Or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:04.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-It was acting, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:05.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But that was the cutest of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.31,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It was...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.85,sign_407_1_Kouban_Private_H,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&H716E9E&\pos(437,49)}Kouban \NPrivate \NHigh \NSchool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.85,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:25.60,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I'm about the only girl who'd \Napproach someone making that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:30.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So going for the "taciturn, cool guy who \Nhandles large props" approach won't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:32.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I think it might be effective \Nif I mastered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gimme some tips, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:41.62,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Think about the emotional side more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:44.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's what I was going for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How come it's so different when you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:47.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is it in the eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.39,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The quiet act...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:54.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard to learn anything \Nwithout words, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:56.38,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Cool act!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:02.13,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Something like that, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I see what you mean. \NI don't know if I can pull that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I like talking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:09.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm probably always \Ngoing to be like this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:14.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.61,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:19.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, I have no idea what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:26.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, you could take \Na break during lunch, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:29.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I have to finish these \Nbefore the culture festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:31.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're desperate for all the help we can get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:34.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I might shrivel up at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Even though my whole plan \Nwas to be a buff stagehand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:45.68,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,S-Since there's no other choice, \NI'll have to feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:48.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Getting fed by Tsundere-chan?! \NYou sure you're not spoiling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'll die tomorrow \Nfrom the luck backlash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:52.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Eat mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,There's no way I deserve \Nto be fed by Cool-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd be locked in for death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:59.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,By the way, we happen to have this prop...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:02.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Could you lend... a paw, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:09.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,M-Meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay! I don't care if I die now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:19.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't believe you can even act like a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:22.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm actually too embarrassed \Nto perform right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:24.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh... wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,My phone's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Did you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:32.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And I was gonna take a picture \Nof Rin-chan in those cat ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:34.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.91,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,If I call his phone to make it ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:40.08,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I can use that as an excuse \Nto get his number!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:41.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:45.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I... I-I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.92,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.14,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:53.59,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I guess I could call your number, \Nbut then you'd have mine, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Quit playing around and help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:59.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You can have the number, so just call it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:02.08,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I dunno, should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:04.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Aw, fine. It's okay if you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.23,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh no! I was a little too impish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:10.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe I could ask Tsundere-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,H-Hurry up and tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:17.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll call your phone, but this \Nis a one-time-only deal, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.11,0:09:22.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's my Tsundere-chan. \NSo understanding. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:25.24,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I should probably thank \Nyou too, Tsundere-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:28.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:33.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:36.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:40.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hello? Senpai, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:43.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing big,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:45.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I appreciate you helping me find my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:55.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's the kind of call you \Nusually make in the evening, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:09.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you the only one around, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone else is in the gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:19.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Could you help me out with this art project?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:21.31,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're good with that sort of thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:23.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:29.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is that really how you ask someone for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:34.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um, w-what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:39.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, ask as Cool-chan this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:44.24,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,You're the only one I can turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I-I guess I better help then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What do you need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.24,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He looks like he's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's from Romeo and Juliet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:00.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Romeo and Juliet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:05.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure how to get \Nthe colors right for sunset...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} your concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:09.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why try such a complicated picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:15.39,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Aw, but I don't know anything about art!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:18.02,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,You're such a good artist, \Nit'd be great if you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Who was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:22.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It was... um... the spoiled girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-It's my desperation move, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.64,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He redid all the colors for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:39.48,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,And behind him was a woman standing \Nsilently in a white kimono...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:45.49,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,And at her feet... a massive swell of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:48.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:51.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're a pro at scary stories, Tsuu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I guess that's what being \Na writer does for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:54.77,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,You're the scariest one here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:55.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't you agree...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.32,sign_17213_188_Dying_Inside__,SFX Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(692,1)\move(591,80,591,179,25,2402)}Dead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.28,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Remember to lock up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.01,main,Club B,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:05.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sure...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:10.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Can't believe it spooked you so bad \Nyou're afraid to change on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:14.20,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I was afraid or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.78,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,B-But keep talking to me! Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.87,0:12:19.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,W-What is it, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:24.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The idea of Tsundere-chan being \Nscared has got me so hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:27.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is Spoiled-chan in there, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.28,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:34.48,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,You can't leave me alone, okay, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:36.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're going to break the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I kind of want to, just to see \Nwhat kind of face you're making!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.93,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Huh. I'm not scared anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:50.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't suppose impish Rin-chan \Nis in there too, is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:53.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't finish changing \Nif you keep interrupting me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:59.00,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(516,282)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:04.01,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(132,288)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.76,main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Wow, I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:10.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:11.17,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:13.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Is... Kitahama-senpai around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:16.22,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Oh, Kitahama's napping over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.35,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Feel free to wake him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:18.17,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:18.68,main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:21.56,main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Seeya, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:22.18,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:23.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh... have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:24.92,main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,She's cute, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.20,main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,More than Kitahama deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The club meeting's started...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.70,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,If you don't wake up, \NI'm gonna play a prank on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:39.82,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He really isn't waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:41.58,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I really could play a prank on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.07,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:44.78,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I need to stop thinking like Imp-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:49.22,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,You'd forgive me even if I did pull \Na prank on you, right, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:55.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think a lack of response \Nmakes this way more embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:58.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Shoot, is it time for club already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:02.32,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He almost saw me as Spoiled-chan! \NThat was a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You went out of your way to get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why are you holding my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:15.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-Imp-chan and the others \Nwere playing a prank on you earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:16.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,They what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.61,0:14:19.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm going back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:24.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Our drama club president's best...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Romeo face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's quite the face all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:33.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got it as my wallpaper, \Nbut I'm kinda tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:38.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Could I trouble the drama club's rising star \Nfor a picture with her cutest face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:46.90,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I want a picture of you too, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:52.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, this looks different...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.24,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,This is a special occasion, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.04,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,And you better not take a weird picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:00.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What is going on here, rising star?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:03.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This is too much, \Neven as a favor to you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:05.64,main,Prez,0,0,0,,What're you two fooling around with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:06.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:10.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura's too embarrassed and \Nher expressions keep coming out weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.51,main,Prez,0,0,0,,What? That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:14.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sorry....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:17.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Show her how it's done, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:18.89,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:20.64,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:23.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The rising star of the \Ndrama club's golden smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:28.94,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Nice! Send it to me too, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:37.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How'd you do on midterms, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Decently, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:42.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What about you, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:44.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:49.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I-If you insist! I'll show you! But this is a \Nspecial occasion! Don't ask again, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.23,0:15:50.42,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Tsundere-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn, Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I have to show you mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:58.87,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's called sharing the shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.06,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Can you keep a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:08.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You seriously think I'd spill a secret \Nfrom Cool-chan without a fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:09.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not that stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:12.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Those are some really bad math scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:15.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So are yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:18.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan seems like she'd be \Npretty calculating, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:23.83,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention in class so \NI could get you to tutor me, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:24.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm going to cram school starting tomorrow! \NTime to get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:27.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Cram school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:30.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe I should study more, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nah, you shouldn't change a thing, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wanna get smart so I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:41.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Math for Imp-chan, \NJapanese history for Tsundere-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:46.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,science for Spoiled-chan, \Nand social studies for Cool-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:49.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm just going to study instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:03.82,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Excuse me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:07.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got into a cooking battle with Tsuu-chan \Nin our self studies period for home ec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:11.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,He's got the lead right now \Nwith the Prez's vote, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.56,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,We want you to vote too, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:17.06,main,Prez,0,0,0,,And we'll announce who made what \Nafterwards, to keep it impartial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:20.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly a gourmet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:23.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Just go with whichever you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now, let the judging begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.20,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,A tastes like it was made \Naccording to the recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.00,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,but B has a bit of a twist to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.56,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Huh. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.77,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,If I choose whichever I like better, \Nand end up not choosing Senpai's cooking...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:42.04,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,That'd be like saying \Nhe's not to my liking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:45.78,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I have to guess which one is his!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:49.92,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,No! I will guess correctly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.91,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem the type to stick \Nto the recipe, so is it B?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:56.14,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,No, he might've followed \Nthe directions to win the contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.26,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai... Senpai would—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura—!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:06.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is technically our lunch, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:09.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now, which is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:11.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,B!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:13.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I like B more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.28,main,Prez,0,0,0,,That's Eiji's cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.57,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh, shouldn't I be celebrating?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.68,main,Shu,0,0,0,,I guess it's a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.66,main,Prez,0,0,0,,And we're out of people to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:31.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now, hang on, what \Nif we got Spoiled-chan to vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:34.15,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't do that embarrassing \Nact in front of actual people!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Aren't I a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Look, I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:40.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But everyone would be so impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:43.48,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,Who's Spoiled-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:46.76,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Kind of... a little act that \NNanakura puts on sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:47.96,main,Tsu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, what if I treat you to lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:51.38,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I already ate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:56.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Have you decided what to wear \Nfor the inter-club relay race yet, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:58.70,sign_27236_333_Two_days_until__,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFDFD&\frz7.789\frx6\fry336\pos(338,56)\b1}{\blur0.4\c&HFFF3F3&}Two days until \Nthe sports festival
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:18:58.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:01.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is definitely the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:05.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't you think it'd be perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:06.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,On Tsundere-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:11.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I think dressing like a princess \Nis a natural fit for a tsundere...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And then Cool-chan in Japanese clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:15.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,As for Imp-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:18.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, I'd be running \Nthe race by myself in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:19.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:23.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please, just pick one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You mean I have to choose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:30.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Only one... only one...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What about the real me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:34.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gotta be loungewear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Loungewear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:37.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But it's supposed to be a costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:38.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Loungewear or nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:41.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I've always wondered what \Nactresses wear at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But... it's just normal t-shirts and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:46.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Nothing worth showing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:55.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Like that? Or that? Maybe that... or this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:58.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah, loungewear it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:19:58.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:09.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Am I trying too hard with the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:12.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder what Senpai will think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai, good mor—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:21.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened to your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:23.49,sign_29239_363_Follicle________,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(314,22)}Follicle                                         Disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I should be asking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:28.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, you look good no matter \Nhow you do your hair, Imp-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:31.74,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe I should do my hair \Nhow you like it next, Senp...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I have to know \Nwhat caused that bedhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:38.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You look good no matter how you do \Nyour hair, Spoiled-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:41.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I have to know \Nwhat caused that bedhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:44.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, I wasn't expecting you \Nto be showing your forehead off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:47.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If I had known I would've fixed my hair, \Neven if it made me late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:52.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can't believe my idiotic bedhead \Nis stealing your amazing forehead gag!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's... not a gag, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, I've got no appeal \Nand no smoothness at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you oversleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:05.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You were running through my thoughts, \Nso I couldn't sleep at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:09.66,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Don't try to be smooth \Nwith your hair like that, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:13.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, making you smile \Nis enough to satisfy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:15.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.17,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Romeo, just call me Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:25.26,main,Club B,0,0,0,,But you're not Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:26.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:38.62,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-I only did it because I'm not cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:40.69,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,And I can't have you getting sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:45.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm so psyched up \Nthat I'm feeling warmer now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.79,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,If you get sick, I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:56.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's the kinda thing I oughta be saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It'd definitely get me girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right, back to the grind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:11.59,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe I should dress lighter tomorrow...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.98,0:22:13.36,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,T-Twelve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.47,0:22:13.97,sign_31948_393_Tomorrow_s_Weath,Sign,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's Weather
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.47,0:22:13.97,sign_31948_393_Tomorrow_s_Weath,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,309)}Cloudy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:19.04,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll have to hang in there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.04,0:22:21.04,main,,0,0,0,,
